comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T04:33:51.530Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for 1269 and provenance_resolver_zero_success plus broader resolver outcomes; read the completed outcome-vocabulary feature and open observability charter in full, and checked open/in-progress work. The new report concerns success accounting after repair rather than the completed outcome-vocabulary or individual resolver fixes. Intake remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-18T13:04:16.399Z","harness:codex","Live baseline: all-status strict inventory contains 2776 items (2461 closed, 242 open, 59 draft, 14 canceled), with no in-progress work before this tranche. GH issue 1269 has canonical linkage; no open PRs or Dependabot, secret-scanning, or code-scanning alerts. Confirmed createHistoryEntry filters resolved outcomes. Probe-sourced success must be distinguished from environment/session observations before enabling success counts. Work is paired with pm-ag9nka under the observability charter."
  "2026-09-18T13:10:47.963Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: both new integration regressions failed against the original implementation. Provenance still reported zero successes after a real SDK mutation with a recovered session probe; executable profiling emitted no invocation total for version/help. Tests use isolated trackers and real filesystem/process boundaries."
  "2026-09-18T13:21:42.337Z","harness:codex",Manual full-health acceptance in a disposable project returned a complete six-event sample with byte count and observed timestamp bounds. Sentry required-mode gate passed with zero high/critical issues in 14 days; live telemetry had 1.54 percent finish errors and zero missing error-code rows. Independent telemetry flush drained one queued row to zero physical bytes. No secret contents or local operational paths are recorded here.
  "2026-09-18T13:26:13.250Z","harness:codex",Graph assurance now passes over all 2777 items after materializing the new prose references as justified typed edges. The unchanged historical redundancy census reports 67 transitive edges; no speculative graph expansion was applied. Production query observed fresh events and 198 of 203 recent sessions with both start and finish records; sampled or in-flight sessions are not treated as complete delivery proof.
  "2026-09-18T13:38:35.909Z","harness:codex","Validation refinement: existing full-storage and no-network boundary assertions now accept the documented sample receipt and real probe successes. The deterministic empty-outcome fixture explicitly disables native probes rather than depending on the current host. All 74 focused tests pass. Strict static quality passes with 100 percent source/API/member documentation and no complexity violations."
  "2026-09-18T13:54:26.455Z","harness:codex","Linked regression execution passed both the genuine resolver recovery/sample suite and the health command/vector boundary suite. Full repository static quality, graph composition, record integrity, and 89-command package-first dogfood passed. Complete history verification matches each active item to its immutable stream with no errors."
  "2026-09-18T14:04:13.926Z","harness:codex","Final local validation passed: 708 files / 9006 tests; exact coverage 64834/64834 statements, 49486/49486 branches, 13456/13456 functions, 62056/62056 lines. No threshold reductions or coverage exclusions were introduced. Full static-quality chain, linked tests, typecheck, 89-command dogfood, packed npm/npx/bunx, installed first-run/MCP/telemetry, docs, and security checks passed. Implementation complete; hosted review and merge are the remaining delivery steps."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T13:54:51.769Z","harness:codex","Compatibility: sample is a required public SDK result field, explicitly acknowledged in the surface snapshot and documented for consumers constructing scan objects. It describes sorted-history-prefix evidence rather than recency. Earlier history is never backfilled with inferred successes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T13:26:14.134Z","harness:codex","A resolved identity value is not sufficient evidence that a resolver succeeded: persist success only when the recorded provenance source is probe, and publish sample completeness before drawing population-wide conclusions."
